Audit all 7 V2 ports against V2Updated designs — match 100%

Ran section-by-section audits of every page ported in the Phase 4/5 work,
fixing every mismatch found against the canonical V2Updated HTML in
`Claude Design Final/V2Updated/`.

/subscription — 5 fixes
- How-it-works container padding (28/40 → 36/40 baseline)
- Removed duplicate USDDisclaimer below tier grid (design has it inside each tier card only)
- In-card USD chip styling (centered, padding 14/6, text-xs, border)
- Cadence callout padding (24/28 mobile, 36/28 desktop)
- Hero reassurance pill row spacing (18px via -mt-3.5 inside PageHero children)

/commercial — 2 fixes
- Metadata description copy ("base" removed)
- Section 02 padding (added top padding to match design)

/services/maps — 5 fixes
- Form field name="scope" → name="size"
- Form field name="reference_urls" → name="references"
- References textarea min-height explicit inline 80px
- USDDisclaimer placement (single centered chip below product grid, not inline per card)
- Replaced 3 inline-styled buttons with shared Button component

