- "Send quote" button now burgundy primary (matches .dv-btn-primary, not gold)
- Header actions gained primary "Send quote" anchor button (jumps to #quote-builder)
- Commission brief field order matches design
- New Communication thread section (auto-receipt entry + disabled reply textarea + "Send reply" disabled button)
- Quick actions expanded from 2 → 4 (Send quote email, Schedule call disabled, Move to portfolio disabled, Archive order posts status=closed)
- New Customer history sidebar card (avatar + initials, prior orders count + total spent via extra Supabase query, first seen month/year, View customer profile link)

